        <parameter>
            <valueName>layer:SOREM:1.0:Broadcast_Text</valueName>
            <value>At 7:43 p.m. Mountain Daylight Time Saturday, Environment Canada has ended a tornado warning for West Central Alberta.  Edson and Niton Junction. Tornadoes associated with this alert are no longer expected in the area. </value>
        </parameter>
